    :oracleText """{T}, Discard a card: Up to one target creature can't be blocked this turn.
Whenever this artifact becomes untapped, you may pay {2}. If you do, draw a card."""@en ;
    :flavorText """"Oh dear... We're really in trouble this time..."
—The Impresario, opera house manager"""@en ;
